{
  "title": "Drizzle",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "Drizzle is a",
        "granular synth. A",
        "small synth",
        "(wavetable or",
        "analog) plays into a",
        "buffer, and every",
        "note you play is a",
        "cloud of grains read",
        "back from it at the",
        "note's pitch. The",
        "first page shows the",
        "buffer, where new",
        "grains start, and",
        "the grains playing",
        "now. Jog turns",
        "pages; Shift+jog-",
        "click opens the",
        "section picker."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Main page",
      "lines": [
        "Pos: where grains",
        "start. Spray: random",
        "spread around it.",
        "Size: grain length.",
        "Dens: grains per",
        "second. PSpr: random",
        "pitch. Scan: moves",
        "the start through",
        "the buffer as notes",
        "play. Space: reverb.",
        "Frz: freeze."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Buffer modes",
      "lines": [
        "Scan renders a tape:",
        "the source sweeping",
        "through its timbres,",
        "0.5 to 8 s long.",
        "Position then picks",
        "a timbre. Turning a",
        "source knob renders",
        "a new tape. Live",
        "records the source",
        "all the time;",
        "Position is how far",
        "back. Freeze holds",
        "either one (CC 69",
        "toggles it)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Wavetable",
      "lines": [
        "Two oscillators over",
        "74 tables of 64",
        "waves. Vintage steps",
        "between waves, 8-bit",
        "style; Clean blends",
        "them. XMod: ring, PM",
        "or sync from B. The",
        "Sweep and the Source",
        "LFO move the wave",
        "position (Timbre)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Analog",
      "lines": [
        "Two band-limited",
        "oscillators: sine,",
        "triangle, saw or",
        "pulse with Shape.",
        "Dens stacks detuned",
        "copies of A; FM,",
        "Sync and Noise",
        "roughen it. Timbre",
        "moves the Shapes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sweep & S.LFO",
      "lines": [
        "Sweep runs once",
        "across a Scan tape",
        "(or over Time in",
        "Live) and moves",
        "Timbre, Fold, Pitch",
        "and Tone. A Sweep on",
        "Pitch makes a",
        "glissando tape:",
        "Position picks",
        "notes, Spray makes",
        "clusters. The Source",
        "LFO adds wobble the",
        "same way."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Grains",
      "lines": [
        "Jitter 0 times",
        "grains evenly: at",
        "high density their",
        "rate is heard as a",
        "buzz. Jitter 1 is a",
        "random cloud. Window",
        "shapes each grain:",
        "Perc for plucks,",
        "Swell for reverse-",
        "like swells, Rect",
        "for hard edges."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pitch & Lock",
      "lines": [
        "Grain Pitch and Fine",
        "transpose. Pitch",
        "Spray picks random",
        "pitches, quantised",
        "to octaves, fifths",
        "or the set's scale.",
        "Reverse plays some",
        "grains backwards.",
        "Lock lines grains",
        "up: at 1 a cloud of",
        "one note becomes a",
        "clean tone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Rhythm",
      "lines": [
        "Mode Tempo plays one",
        "grain per step of",
        "Div, on Move's",
        "tempo. Swing delays",
        "every other step.",
        "Prob drops steps,",
        "Rpt repeats a grain,",
        "Rand Note or Bar",
        "makes the pattern",
        "repeat: Bar loops it",
        "every bar."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Filter & Env",
      "lines": [
        "Each voice has a",
        "filter (off by",
        "default) and two",
        "envelopes. The Mod",
        "Env moves Position,",
        "Size, Density, Pitch",
        "and Cutoff. Release",
        "thinning lets tails",
        "thin out instead of",
        "just fading."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Modulation",
      "lines": [
        "LFO 1 runs per note,",
        "LFO 2 for all notes",
        "and can lock to the",
        "bar. Mod Matrix: 12",
        "slots of source x",
        "via to destination.",
        "Macros 1-4 are",
        "sources there;",
        "factory patches use",
        "them for motion,",
        "texture, space and a",
        "trick."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pressure",
      "lines": [
        "Pad pressure plays",
        "the cloud: it moves",
        "density and spray by",
        "default, and",
        "Position, Size,",
        "Pitch Spray and",
        "Cutoff from the",
        "Pressure page."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "FX",
      "lines": [
        "Crush (Bits for",
        "8-bit grit), Chorus,",
        "Delay (tempo sync,",
        "ping-pong) and",
        "Reverb. Reverb Cloud",
        "decays up to 60 s;",
        "RFrz holds the",
        "reverb tank."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Tips",
      "lines": [
        "Freeze a Live patch,",
        "then play high notes",
        "over it. Lock 1 plus",
        "Pitch Spray Oct",
        "makes organ chords.",
        "Tempo, Rpt 3 and",
        "Rand Bar make a",
        "glitch loop that",
        "repeats exactly."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
